<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <span class="pill">APIs · Automation software · Integrations</span>
    <h1>APIs and automation software that do the repetitive work for you<br><small>Ready-to-use APIs, licensed automation tools and fixed-price software builds</small></h1>
    <p class="lead">Subscribe to an API plan and get your key instantly, run our automation tools on a pay-per-use basis, or order a custom build at a fixed price.
      Every plan has a clear quota and price, and usage is visible in real time in your customer portal.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/pricing" class="btn primary big">See plans &amp; pricing</a>
      <a href="/portal/login" class="btn big">Customer login</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-points">
      <li>API key issued as soon as payment is confirmed</li>
      <li>Monthly or yearly plans with a fixed quota</li>
      <li>Pay by <%= co.PAY.paymentMethods %>, receipt with your company tax ID</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="shot">
    <div class="hero-panel">
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">🤖</span><div><b>AI API Key</b><br><span class="muted">Chat, vision/OCR, image generation</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">⚙️</span><div><b>AI Web Tools</b><br><span class="muted">Web-portal bots, bulk extraction, Excel workflows</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">📊</span><div><b>Usage dashboard</b><br><span class="muted">Real-time metering, invoices and receipts</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-foot muted small">Self-service portal · API keys · usage-based billing</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services" class="features">
  <h2>Products</h2>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🤖</div><h3>AI API Key</h3>
      <p>One OpenAI-compatible API key for chat completions, vision/OCR on images and PDFs, and image generation. Monthly plans with a credit quota, multiple keys and rate limits per plan.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">⚙️</div><h3>AI Web Tools</h3>
      <p>Licensed desktop automation for web portals: bulk extraction, document downloads and Excel-driven form filling. Billed by tokens per record processed, with dry-run mode and confirmation steps.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">📊</div><h3>Usage portal</h3>
      <p>Every API call and tool job is metered in real time. Keys, licences, invoices and receipts in one customer portal.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🧩</div><h3>Fixed-price custom builds</h3>
      <p>Need a bot, portal or connector we don't offer off the shelf? We build it to a written specification at a fixed price and deliver the source code.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">☁️</div><h3>Managed hosting</h3>
      <p>Hosting, automated backups, uptime monitoring and security updates for software we delivered, billed monthly.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="process" class="how">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><b>Choose a plan</b> on the pricing page: monthly, yearly or pay-as-you-go.</li>
    <li><b>Pay online</b> by <%= co.PAY.paymentMethods %>. Your receipt is issued automatically.</li>
    <li><b>Get your API key or licence</b> straight away in the customer portal.</li>
    <li><b>Track usage</b> in real time; invoices and receipts are generated automatically.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="pricing" class="pricing">
  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <p class="lead">API and software plans are billed monthly or yearly with a clear monthly quota. Pay-as-you-go tools are billed per unit used. Custom builds have a fixed price.
    All payments go through <%= co.PAY.name %>, and receipts carry your company name and tax ID.</p>
  <p class="center"><a href="/pricing" class="btn primary">See plans &amp; pricing →</a></p>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="faq">
  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <details><summary>What is <%= co.PRODUCT_NAME %>?</summary><p><%= co.PRODUCT_NAME %> is an API and automation software platform operated by <%= co.COMPANY_NAME %>, Pathum Thani, Thailand.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How fast can I start?</summary><p>Request a customer account, then subscribe in the portal. Your API key or licence is issued as soon as payment is confirmed.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How am I charged?</summary><p>Three options: a <b>monthly or yearly plan</b> with a fixed quota, <b>pay-as-you-go</b> per unit used, or a <b>fixed price</b> for a custom build. See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What happens when I reach my quota?</summary><p>Plans without overage pricing pause until the quota resets. Plans with overage pricing keep running and the extra usage is billed per unit on your next invoice.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who owns my data?</summary><p>You do. Data sent to our APIs is processed only to return your result. Our automation tools keep your business data on your own systems; we receive only usage counts for billing. See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who issues the receipt?</summary><p><%= co.PAY.name %> processes payments as Merchant of Record, issues the receipt, handles sales tax and appears on your card statement. You can add your company name, address and tax ID.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes, at any time in the customer portal. You keep access until the end of the paid period. Pay-as-you-go tools have no minimum; months without usage are not invoiced.</p></details>
</section>

<section class="contactcta">
  <h2>Questions about a plan?</h2>
  <p>Email <% if (co.COMPANY_EMAIL) { %><a href="mailto:<%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %>"><%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %></a><% } %> or <a href="/contact">send us a message</a> (<%= co.SUPPORT_HOURS %>).</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
